'''Antidote''' (Alt: ''Antidote'') is a 3<sup>rd</sup> class active skill available as [[Guillotine Cross]].

==Effect==
Cures a single target of the [[New Poison Research|New Poison]] status. Each cast consumes an {{item|id=6128 Antidote}}.


