'''Arrow Crafting''' (Alt: ''Making Arrow'') is a 1<sup>st</sup> class active skill available as [[Archer]]. This skill can only be learned through a certain quest.
__TOC__
==Effect==
Crafts [[arrows]] from a specified item. This skill cannot be used if the user is at 50% [[Weight Limit|weight]] or more.

==Crafting==
Go {{plainlink|url=http://db.irowiki.org/db/arrow-craft/ here}} for a list of materials needed. For all lists, all items in ''italics'' are buyable through NPC.
