'''Bomb Creation''' (Alt: ''Create Bomb'') is a 3<sup>rd</sup> class active skill available as [[Geneticist]].
==Effect==
Creates explosives out of various kinds of fruit. Requires the user to have at least one volume from the {{item|id=6279 How}} {{item|id=6280 To}} {{item|id=6281 Make}} {{item|id=6282 Bombs}} {{item|id=6283 series}}, depending on the fruit bomb the user wants to create. They can be purchased from the [[Al De Baran|Craft Book Salesman]] {{navi|alde_alche|31|186}} on the first floor of the [[Alchemist]] job change building.

===Notes=== 
*Level 1 requires one set of ingredients, while Level 2 requires 10 sets of ingredients.
*Success Rate for created items are applied separately. For example: 10 sets for a Bomb would have created 4 Bombs and 6 Black Lumps, instead of 10 Black Lumps despite having failed in the process.

==Success Rate==
Success Rate compares two values: ''Creation'' and ''Difficulty''. If Creation results higher than Difficulty, bombs are successfully created, otherwise the creation fails.

 <span style="white-space:normal;">'''Creation''' = (Job_Lv ÷ 4) + (DEX ÷ 3) + (LUK ÷ 2)</span>
 <span style="white-space:normal;">'''Difficulty''' = Random(30, 150) + Item_Rate</span>

'''For Level 2:'''
*If Creation > Difficulty by at least 30, 10~12 bombs are created.
*If Creation > Difficulty by at least 10, 10 bombs are created.
*If Creation < Difficulty by exactly 10, 8 bombs are created.
*If Creation < Difficulty by at least 30, 5 bombs are created.
*If Creation < Difficulty by at least 50, the creation fails.

