*This skill does not plagiarize [[:Category:Monster Exclusive Skills|Monster Exclusive Skills]], [[Transcendent]] or 3rd class skills.
*This skill can copy certain skills that are performed at a higher level by monsters than their player variant would allow. For example, [[Water Ball]] Lv. 10, [[Claymore Trap]] Lv. 10.
*This skill cannot copy [[Blessing]] and [[Increase AGI]], even though they do 1 damage to the player due to the monster skill [[NPC CHANGEUNDEAD|Property Change (Undead)]].
*[[Equipment]] and [[Card System|cards]] that autocast the highest level of a skill will not work with a plagiarized skill.
*[[Tomahawk Throwing]] is currently the only non-naturally learned skill that is copyable by Intimidate.

