== Hunting Guide for Materials ==
=== Monster Drops ===
* Prickly Fruit: Best from {{monster|id=1633 Beholder}} (Rachel Sanctuary) or {{monster|id=3444 Watcher}} (Prontera Underground Prison).
* Maneater Root: {{monster|id=1368 Geographer}} ([[Juno]] Fields) or {{monster|id=1162 Rafflesia}} (Lighthalzen Field).
* Mushroom Spore: {{monster|id=1084 Black Mushroom}}, {{monster|id=1085 Red Mushroom}} (Both found throughout Rune-Midgard) or {{monster|id=1014 Spores}} in {{map|id=pay_fild08 Payon Forest}}.
* Poison Spore: {{monster|id=1077 Poison Spore}} {{map|id=gef_dun00 Geffen Dungeon}}.
* Gun Powder: {{monster|id=1616 Pitman}} in {{map|id=ein_dun01 Einbech Mine Dungeon Floor 1}} or {{monster|id=1616 Heater}} in {{map|id=tur_dun03 Turtle Dungeon 3 and 4}}.
* White Herb: Best from {{monster|id=1036 Ghoul}} ({{map|id=gl_church Glast Heim ST. Abbey}} & {{map|id=chyard Churchyard}}), {{monster|id=1082 White Plant}}, {{monster|id=1367 Blazer}} and {{monster|id=1366 Lava Golem}} in [[Magma Dungeon]].
* Grape: {{monster|id=1031 Poporing}} (most found in {{map|id=pay_fild04 Payon Field 04}}) or {{monster|id=20652 Pitaya}} (in {{map|id=ba_lost Farm Lost Valley}}).
* Honey: Generally found from {{monster|id=1060 Bigfoot}} and Turtles.
* Blue Herb: Found throughout Rune-Midgard, mainly through {{monster|id=1079 Blue Plant}}, {{monster|id=1372 Goat}} or {{monster|id=1061 Nightmare}}.

=== Buyable ===
* Empty Test Tube: Found in the {{shop|id=gef_mage Mage Guild}} in Northwest [[Geffen]].
* Empty Potion Bottles: Found in the {{shop|id=gef_mage Mage Guild}} in Northwest [[Geffen]].
* White Potion: Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* Concentration Potion: Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* Awakening Potion: Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* Spicy Sauce (On Euro Hot Sauce): Northwest from Morroc in {{map|id=moc_ruins Morocc Ruins}}.

=== Crafted or Otherwise ===
* Alcohol: Can be either crafted with [[Potion Creation]], farmed with {{item List|id=2976|item=Red Lantern|slots=1|simple=y}} or found by killing {{monster|id=1084 Black Mushroom}} and {{monster|id=1085 Red Mushroom}}.

