===Notes===
*The [[Soul Linker]] who provides the [[Alchemist Spirit]] must be in the same party as a [[TaeKwon Kid]], and they must be within 18 cells of each other on the same map. The [[Alchemist]] does not need to be in the same party.
*The user does not need the materials to create everything. However, all of the manuals are still required to be in the inventory, and the user must have at least 200 medicine bowls and 200 empty bottles. As of 6/30/13, the user can choose to create only one of the three items at a time. This seems to work for {{item|id=970 Alcohols}} and {{item|id=7136 Acid Bottles}}, but not {{item|id=7135 Bottle Grenades}}.




